<title>BRAZIL: Brazilt to announce Treasury data for September.</title>
<headline>Brazilt to announce Treasury data for September.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Treasury will release later on Thursday data on the performance of federal accounts during the month of September, a Finance Ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>National Treasury Secretary Murilo Portugal was due to announce the figures at 1100 local/1300 GMT, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
